---
---
<section class="section bg-cool">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--accent-text)">Curriculum + Analytics</span>
    <div class="feature-split">
      <div class="feat-text">
        <span class="script script-xl" style="color:var(--accent-text)">Track Progress. See Results.</span>
        <h2 class="headline">See exactly where every student stands.</h2>
        <p class="subhead">A per-student progress view that brings it together: current ASHR tier for Math and Reading, recent test pass-rate trends, and level velocity measured against your center's cohort. Every number reads live from your own records.</p>
        <div class="feat-points">
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">ASHR tier position</strong><br>Where each student sits on the medal scale, Below Grade through Platinum, for Math and Reading</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Pass rate and level velocity</strong><br>Recent pass-rate trend next to months-per-level pacing, benchmarked to your cohort average</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Live, from your own data</strong><br>Every chart reads straight from your records in real time. No exports, no spreadsheets.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"/><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Test recording and placement</strong><br>Log passes, retests, and borderline results, and set a baseline level on intake</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div><a href="#" class="btn btn-founding" data-cta="Book a Demo">Book a Demo</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-visual">
        <div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(224,113,44,.15),transparent 68%);width:120%;height:124%;top:-12%;left:-10%"></div>
        <div class="shot"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1854" height="1207" src="/images/insights.webp" alt="Insights and analytics"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
